; ---- and what it sounds like underneath -----------------------------------
;
; Which of these plays is the place's and the moment's: the Audio block's Music
; list (data/world/scene.duke) names one for the menu, the capital, the open
; world, the descent, a fight, a boss, the turning and the end, and the client
; cross-fades between them as he goes (Soundscape). Each loops while it plays.
;
; All ten are CC0, from OpenGameArt's "CC0 - Cinematic Music" collection; who
; made each is in CREDITS.md. Levelled to about -18 LUFS, so Gain is the knob
; that is left for taste. The first is the one the settings screen starts on.

Sound
  Name = music.explore
  Channel = Music
  Positional = No
  Gain = 0.6
  Label = The Hope
  Files = [audio/music/explore.ogg]
End

